# NOTE: vendor/ and public/build/ are intentionally NOT ignored in this repo.
# The production server has no Composer or Node/npm available, so we commit
# the installed dependencies and the compiled frontend assets directly, and
# the .cpanel.yml deploy task just copies them into place. Always run
# `composer install` and `npm run build` locally before committing, so what's
# in git is what actually runs on the server.
